    {
        "id":"lake_map",
        "name":"A map of the Great Lake Laeroth",
        "showInLog":1,
        "stages":[
            {
                "progress":10,
                "logText":"The cartographer Thyrope Splathershed asked me to join an exploration to get the maps of Lake Laeroth completed."
            },
            {
                "progress":12,
                "logText":"I should get beeswax from Leofric the beekeeper to make earplugs."
            },
            {
                "progress":20,
                "logText":"On a paradisiacal-looking island, Kalypso welcomed me and offered refreshment."
            },
            {
                "progress":22,
                "logText":"I took a grape to try her food. It was an extraordinary boost for my body."
            },
            {
                "progress":24,
                "logText":"Kalypso gave me a tiny green key as a present."
            },
            {
                "progress":26,
                "logText":"I realized that I didn't have the urge to leave anymore."
            },
            {
                "progress":28,
                "logText":"Once the magic had worn off, I was able to leave the island again."
            },
            {
                "progress":30,
                "logText":"You met Circe, a strange, lonely woman who kept pigs in her kitchen."
            },
            {
                "progress":31,
                "logText":"We docked at an unknown island. Captain Burry and his men set off to replenish supplies."
            },
            {
                "progress":32,
                "logText":"The ship was abandoned. Something was strange about that Circe, I decided to question her."
            },
            {
                "progress":34,
                "logText":"I realized that the Captain and his crew had been turned into pigs, and I forced Circe to turn them back."
            },
            {
                "progress":36,
                "logText":"Impressed, Circe gave me a golden key as a parting gift."
            },
            {
                "progress":40,
                "logText":"We approached the Sirens' Reef. Many sailors have lost their lives here. Captain Burry refused to sail any further."
            },
            {
                "progress":42,
                "logText":"I distributed earplugs to the crew so that the sirens' songs could no longer harm them."
            },
            {
                "progress":44,
                "logText":"Then I put in earplugs too.",
                "rewardExperience":1000
            },
            {
                "progress":46,
                "logText":"I had myself tied tightly to the mast so that I could hear what the sirens were singing without jumping overboard.",
                "rewardExperience":2000
            },
            {
                "progress":48,
                "logText":"We have managed to passage by the Sirens' cliff."
            },
            {
                "progress":50,
                "logText":"I was exploring a cave on an island with just sheep, when suddenly the dwarvish cyclops Polyphem enters, together with a flock of sheep. Polyphem has locked the door behind him."
            },
            {
                "progress":52,
                "logText":"He and his brothers would eat me in the next days."
            },
            {
                "progress":54,
                "logText":"Polyphem fell onto his bed and immediatly began to snore. I should find a way to leave."
            },
            {
                "progress":55,
                "logText":"I made a strong soap solution."
            },
            {
                "progress":56,
                "logText":"And poured it directly into Polyphem's eye."
            },
            {
                "progress":57,
                "logText":"Polyphem let all the sheep out so he could more easily search the cave for me. As he did so, he felt each sheep's back and counted them."
            },
            {
                "progress":58,
                "logText":"I hung myself from the side of a strong sheep to let it pull me to freedom."
            },
            {
                "progress":59,
                "logText":"It worked! I've left the cave.",
                "rewardExperience":5000
            },
            {
                "progress":60,
                "logText":"Scylla, the six headed monster, had attacked our ship."
            },
            {
                "progress":70,
                "logText":"We were swept into the abyss of the maelstrom along with the ship."
            },
            {
                "progress":78,
                "logText":"At last we resurfaced again."
            },
            {
                "progress":900,
                "logText":"Looks like we had got the map of the great Lake Laeroth complete."
            },
            {
                "progress":910,
                "logText":"Thyrope Splathershed is happy to have the map complete now. He seemed to doubt my story though, but he allowed me to use the ship for my leisure.",
                "rewardExperience":5000,
                "finishesQuest":1
            }
        ]
